<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings rise in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings rise in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended February 22, roastings totaled approximately 400,000 60-kg bags, up from 300,000 bags the previous week and compared with 370,000 bags in the corresponding week one year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 2,990,000 60-kg bags, versus 2,890,000 bags in the same year ago period.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
